      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We report two heterozygous carriers of c.464A>G variation in the GJB2 gene in a Chinese pedigree. The proband with hearing loss most likely inherited the c.464A>G variation from his mother who also carries heterozygous c.79G>A variation and has normal hearing. The pathological significance of c.464A>G variation remains to be determined."},
